.....","alt":"voice/char_494_vendla/cn_031.mp3"}],"失败":[{"url":"bwiki:e/e5/46igdo336klve9lepsk8z6142dxrdys.mp3","text":"它们的花瓣......碎了。","alt":"voice/char_494_vendla/cn_032.mp3"}],"进驻":[{"url":"bwiki:9/9a/dc1u8w00xde8slnnophxhanhuct31p8.mp3","text":"好冷清，博士喜欢的风格是这样的吗？","alt":"voice/char_494_vendla/cn_033.mp3"}],"戳一下":[{"url":"bwiki:b/b1/bidlms5zy7njda7lfm6fqs60605s2js.mp3","text":"咦，想要买花吗？","alt":"voice/char_494_vendla/cn_034.mp3"}],"信赖触摸":[{"url":"bwiki:7/7f/jz13i1wrbku2kgvmzxg6ypem3cadncl.mp3","text":"欸，头上的花被您碰掉了。","alt":"voice/char_494_vendla/cn_036.mp3"}],"标题":[{"url":"bwiki:5/54/3s7xngy89hzp1q0iszd2zgyih5bh72p.mp3","text":"明日方舟。","alt":"voice/char_494_vendla/cn_037.mp3"}],"新年":[{"url":"bwiki:8/8b/3bzw5w7g01yw9bl34d0uw6yxkqyouh8.mp3","text":"博士，新年快乐！您说大家房间门口的礼物？那是一品红，过往新年夜我都会在小镇每一户的门口放上一束庆祝新年......我不希望这个美好的仪式因为那场变故而消失。","alt":"voice/char_494_vendla/cn_038.mp3"}],"问候":[{"url":"bwiki:c/c5/mvdh3r8wqkftln7cm0vtbfzlq92ckhf.mp3","text":"博士，被您发现了。这是我刚培育的新品种，喜欢吗？","alt":"voice/char_494_vendla/cn_042.mp3"}]}}